1
00:00:00,732 --> 00:00:03,342
(Howard:)Tomato, tomahto.
The important thing is she's dead.

2
00:00:05,904 --> 00:00:07,974
(Bernadette:)Hey, so how come you two
didn't move in together?

3
00:00:08,073 --> 00:00:09,713
(Leonard:)This guy wanted
a place of his own

4
00:00:09,841 --> 00:00:12,151
(Leonard:)because he was sure he was
gonna be a ladies' man.

5
00:00:14,045 --> 00:00:15,755
(Raj:)Yeah, I was wrong.

6
00:00:16,848 --> 00:00:19,558
(Raj:)But I do think you and I
would have had a great time.

7
00:00:19,684 --> 00:00:22,424
(Raj:)Come on, Leonard, dinner.

8
00:00:22,587 --> 00:00:24,537
(Sheldon:)Coming.

9
00:00:33,264 --> 00:00:34,264
(Raj:)Hang on.

10
00:00:34,499 --> 00:00:36,209
(Leonard:)Why would I be fat?

11
00:00:37,268 --> 00:00:39,548
(Raj:)You'd have no girlfriend
to see you naked,

12
00:00:39,671 --> 00:00:42,281
(Raj:)you'd try to fill the void
with food,

13
00:00:42,407 --> 00:00:45,187
(Raj:)and I'm an enabler who once
deep-fried a pancake.

14
00:00:46,211 --> 00:00:47,881
(Leonard:)Why can't you be fat too?

15
00:00:49,914 --> 00:00:51,554
(Fat Leonard:)What do you want
to do for dessert?

16
00:00:54,686 --> 00:00:59,026
(Fat Raj:)I think there's still
half a cake from breakfast.

